# ================================
# Condor: raw-feature AE baseline on the CASE signals of the collide_v2 production,
# the same 20,000 events per signal as the encoders (--dataset case_v2), scored against
# the QCD test events of the published raw HH->4b row.
#   condor_submit scripts/xai/submit/case_v2_raw.sub
# ================================
executable = scripts/xai/submit/wrapper_case_raw.sh
arguments  = $(ClusterId)

log_dir = /afs/cern.ch/user/d/dgenoves/foundation_model_testing_for_AD/logs/condor_logs/xai
output  = $(log_dir)/case_v2_raw_$(ClusterId).out
error   = $(log_dir)/case_v2_raw_$(ClusterId).err
log     = $(log_dir)/case_v2_raw_$(ClusterId).log

run_as_owner   = True
+JobFlavour    = "tomorrow"
getenv         = False
request_cpus   = 8
request_memory = 24576

# DATASET set explicitly: the wrapper defaults to the first CASE production.
environment = "DATASET=case_v2 OMP_NUM_THREADS=8 MKL_NUM_THREADS=8"

queue
